 ds_map_add(m,"Do you want me to help you in battles?","要我帮你战斗吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I know .. I guess it will hurt my mother if I never get better as a succubus.","我知道……如果作为魅魔一直没进步，妈妈大概会很难过。");
 ds_map_add(m,"But I was always such a shy girl, that I never asked my mother to teach me.","可我一直特别害羞，从来没开口请妈妈教我。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey! What's wrong? Line is a great succubus!","喂！怎么了？莱茵明明是个很棒的魅魔！");
