 ds_map_add(m,"I will give you a prize, just come behind the counter.","给你个奖励，来柜台后面吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmmm yeah, I took it from a slime cat, I think it looks pretty good on me.","嗯，是啊。从一只史莱姆猫那里拿的，我觉得还挺适合我。");
