 ds_map_add(m,"My briefcase should be here somewhere","我的公文包应该就在这附近。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes please I am a little tired.","是的，麻烦了，我有点累。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And how are you supposed to do your justice, you don't kill them... right?","你打算怎么伸张正义？不会杀掉他们……对吧？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh I am sorry it's just weird to see someone here at night... and naked. :v","哦，不好意思。只是晚上在这里遇到别人，还是光着的……有点奇怪。:v");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well... I came on vacation to this island but I spent my money driking milk.","嗯……我是来岛上度假的，结果喝牛奶把钱花光了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Haha its ok take care.","哈哈，没事，保重。");
 ds_map_add(m,"She is very sorry, say sorry *covers Line's mouth*","她非常抱歉，快道歉。*捂住莱茵的嘴*");
 ds_map_add(m,"Finally I finished cleaning this floor, Mr.Cabello will be happy <3.","这层楼终于打扫完了，卡贝洛先生会高兴的<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And how I got there!","那我又是怎么进去的！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmmm yes I am surprised to find fans here, was it because of the back cover?","嗯，在这里碰见粉丝，真是意外。是看了封底才来的吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ehh it must be because of the years it was stored out in the open hehe.","呃，应该是因为在露天放了太多年吧，嘿嘿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Great it's only 5000 Arcs","太好了，只要5000阿克币。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Now I want to be a furry!","我现在也想当兽人控了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh you talk about Miss Marael what a nice woman she was my first time.","哦，你说的是玛拉艾尔女士啊。多好的女人，我的第一次就是给她的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Did you get the money?","钱凑齐了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Let's go home Lili, I need your help!","莉莉，回家吧，我需要你帮忙！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh it's okay I'll wait here <3.","哦，没关系，我在这里等<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, everything is here. (pay 5000 Arcs)","是，都在这里。（支付5000阿克币。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"Go Line I know what you want to do.","去吧，莱茵，我知道你想做什么。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh Mmmm (exactly, pretend to think so they don't find out you're desperate).","哦，嗯……（没错，装作在考虑，别让人看出自己已经急不可耐。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"Please someone get this girl out of my vital space.","谁来把这姑娘从我的私人空间里弄出去，拜托。");
 ds_map_add(m,"No no no we are just travelers looking for our friend ;c.","不不不，我们只是来找朋友的旅人;c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Eh, I'm not the bartender but if you want I'll call her.","呃，我不是调酒师，不过可以帮你叫她。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And I think with this fight the effect of the beer were off Hahaha.","打完这场架，我感觉酒都醒了，哈哈哈。");
 ds_map_add(m,"it doesn't matter break his ass Line!","不管了！莱茵，揍烂他的屁股！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I need you to come with me because of you an innocent woman will go to jail!","你得跟我走！因为你，一个无辜的女人就要坐牢了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah and where is your partner Whipsy :c?","是啊，你的搭档薇普西呢:c？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wow, I didn't think anyone would recognize me around here.","哇，没想到在这里会被认出来。");
 ds_map_add(m,"You come for the rematch?","来复仇了？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Haha it's very simple, I do a lot of impact damage.","哈哈，很简单，我能造成大量冲击伤害。");
 ds_map_add(m,"No sorry, could you tell me again how you fight?","不了，抱歉。能再讲讲你是怎么战斗的吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Now you have time to help me catch the criminal?","现在有空帮我抓罪犯了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sorry but, could you tell me again how you fight?","抱歉，不过能再讲讲你是怎么战斗的吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you know where he went or if anyone saw him?","知道他去哪儿了，或者有没有人见过他？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Calm down, I will help you.","冷静，我会帮你的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah, she went to the cultivation of nana leaves","嗯，她去种娜娜叶的地方了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am happy to hear you are ok.","听到你没事，我就放心了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"AHhh. my head how did I get here, Hi-Hikari is that you?","啊啊……头好痛，我怎么到这里来了？光、光，是你吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"When you have the money come see me on the top floor of the hotel.","钱凑够了，就来酒店顶层找我。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Haha so cute I'm sorry but I charged large amounts of money.","哈哈，真可爱。不过不好意思，我收费可高了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes- yes I think you were this escort for shy succubus.","对、对，我记得你是专门陪害羞魅魔的应召女郎。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I don't think a girl with such innocent looks knows who I am.","你看着这么清纯，不像会知道我是谁的姑娘。");
 ds_map_add(m,"The first to undress the other wins.","谁先把对方脱光，谁就赢。");
 ds_map_add(m,"sorry it's a bad habit from the past let's try again <3.","对不起，以前留下的坏习惯，再来一次吧<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh but something bad will happen but not to me.","哦，是会发生坏事，不过倒霉的可不是我。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Excuse? What the fuck did you say.","不好意思？你他妈说什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"She says get out of this place something could happen to you.","她说，离开这里，不然你可能出事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"So she's probably fine.","那她应该没事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"But why would it be a bad idea to come? seems like a nice place.","不过，为什么不能来？这里看着不错啊。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili!! ok im sorry for everything ok bye.","莉莉！！好了，所有的事都对不起，行了吧，再见。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Blub blub blip :c","咕噜，咕噜，哔:c");
 ds_map_add(m,"AHHHH that's what he said! Believe me or not that's your problem.","啊啊啊，他就是这么说的！信不信随你。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What did he say?","他说什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Bleb Bleb blub blub bleb,blub blub, blip blop blop.","咕噜，咕噜，咕噜咕噜，啵，咕噜咕噜，哔，啵啵。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am Sieki and I really meant how you got here?","我叫茜姬，我问的是，你到底怎么进来的？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wait for me in the forest south of the hospital.","到医院南边的森林等我。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Captain, I found a relic in the forest.","队长，我在森林里发现了一件圣物。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Have you left the relic at the church already?","已经把圣物送到教堂了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"We already know what to do Line!","莱茵，我们知道该怎么做了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"No, stay out of the issue, citizens.","不行，市民，请不要插手。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, what if we help solve those problems?","喂，要是我们能帮忙解决呢？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Now you cannot enter the barn.","现在不能进谷仓。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Remember, don't be heroes, not everyone can be a guard of Elira.","记住，别逞英雄，不是谁都能当艾莉拉卫兵的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh thank you very much, by chance you have seen a woman with wings on her head.","哦，非常感谢。对了，有没有见过一个头上长翅膀的女人？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Everything indicates that so far.","目前的线索都指向这个结论。");
 ds_map_add(m,"The traveler defeated a succubus but this is a high rank demon.","旅人确实打败过魅魔，但这次可是高阶恶魔。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This for you traveler!!!","为了你，旅人！！！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm finall *hip* drunk enough to tell Callie to go out with me.","我终于*嗝*喝够了，敢叫卡莉跟我约会了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This is so boring.","无聊死了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"what and were there people there ?!","什么，那里还有人？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Understood Miss Faery.","明白，妖精小姐。");
 ds_map_add(m,"The great captain told me to stay here until she came back.","大队长让我留在这里，等她回来。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Now let us pass!","现在让我们过去！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Look Line there's a trace of this thing coming behind the red tent.","看，莱茵，那东西留下的痕迹，从红色帐篷后面过来了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm afraid that is more serious than that.","恐怕不只是这样。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh c'mon are just pranks how serious it can be.","拜托，只是恶作剧，能有多严重。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And the guards are blaming me.","卫兵却全怪到我头上。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mom there is a cat doing pranks to people.","妈妈，有只猫在捉弄别人。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Calm love, I'll be back in a few days.","别担心，亲爱的，我过几天就回来。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Of course not, you closet slut.","当然不是，你这闷骚婊子。");
 ds_map_add(m,"But, I don't really care much about those powers.","可是，我对那些能力其实没多大兴趣。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What?! b-but these clothes are sacred, my father will be very angry :c.","什么？！可、可这些衣服是神圣的，爸爸会很生气的:c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh no, Lili and now what have you done.","不好，莉莉，你这次又干了什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"But for what, the magic clothes that my father gave me are enough to fight.","可为什么？爸爸给我的魔法衣服，已经够用来战斗了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line to take off your boots.","莱茵，把靴子脱掉。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What are we going to do Lili :s.","莉莉，我们要怎么办:s？");
 ds_map_add(m,"AHHH FORGET WHAT YOU SAW!","啊啊啊，忘掉你看到的！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I might know where he could be.","我也许知道他在哪儿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"If I help you, could you help us by getting information from my friend?","如果帮你，你能帮我们打听朋友的消息吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Go to the door on the left she will be waiting for you.","去左边那扇门，她在那里等你。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Geez Line control yourself.","老天，莱茵，克制一下。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Welcome to the green hills hotel.","欢迎来到绿丘酒店。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sorry here just let us say moo.","抱歉，这里只许我们说“哞”。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you lady unicorn but be careful that cat likes to prank people :c.","谢谢你，独角兽女士，不过要小心，那只猫喜欢捉弄人:c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"yeah just give use the money","对，把钱给我们就行。");
 ds_map_add(m,"We take the money","我们拿走钱。");
 ds_map_add(m,"sounds really easy actually","听着还真挺简单。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh ok what do we have to do?","哦，好，我们要做什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I don't know Line having money is always good","不知道，莱茵，有钱总是好的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Great just sign here.","很好，在这里签字。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I gave you 1000 arcs plus 10%, you should give me back 1100.","我借你1000阿克币，加10%的利息，你该还我1100。");
 ds_map_add(m,"He-hello could you lend me money again?","你、你好，能再借我点钱吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do not believe her little girl, she is joking.","小姑娘，别信她，她在开玩笑。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Please help miss traveler.","旅人小姐，请帮帮忙。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Be careful stepping on the mushrooms.","小心别踩到蘑菇。");
 ds_map_add(m,"If you have anything you can help me with please let me know!","有什么我能帮忙的，尽管告诉我！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey I hope my advice is helping you <3","喂，希望我的建议帮到你了<3");
 ds_map_add(m,"Haha I would also like you to come to my house for lunch.","哈哈，我也想请你来家里吃午饭。");
 ds_map_add(m,"You will love it, it is cheap, tasty and fast <3 .","你会喜欢的，便宜、好吃，还快<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh give me a second Honey, I'm doing the dishes.","哦，亲爱的，等我一下，我在洗碗。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I don't know, the librarian is missing so the library is closed.","不知道，图书管理员失踪了，所以图书馆关门了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Aw man, I wanted to go to the library.","唉，本来还想去图书馆呢。");
 ds_map_add(m,"if you're going to trust that demon","你真要相信那个恶魔的话。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What's wrong with you, why do you escape from me?","你怎么了，为什么要躲着我？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm sorry but I haven't seen her around here.","抱歉，我没在这附近见过她。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Welcome to the bar fluid sky.","欢迎来到流液天空酒吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"*covers Line's mouth and murmurs* shut-up.","*捂住莱茵的嘴，小声说*闭嘴。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Let me give you something for all the trouble.","给你点东西，补偿你受的麻烦。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Then the rain washes it away.","随后，雨水将它冲走。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Stones it brings.","它带来石头。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Leave uncomfortably without saying goodbye.","尴尬地离开，不说再见。");
 ds_map_add(m,"B-but what if she gets angry?","可、可是，她要是生气了怎么办？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh this is bad :c.","哦，这下糟了:c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you want to participate to find out who is the best Onahole?","想参加比赛，看看谁是最棒的人形飞机杯吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"And that does not include us, we were born with this hair color.","那可不包括我们，我们天生就是这个发色。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey but you didn't answer my question!","喂，你还没回答我的问题！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, are you the bartender's sister?","喂，你是调酒师的姐妹吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Welcome to the 1 V 1 for the GLORY! hole.","欢迎来到一对一，为了荣耀——之洞！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Welcome, are you coming back to compete?","欢迎，还要来比赛吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes of course? (wow, she's very pretty)","嗯，当然？（哇，她真漂亮。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hi can i ask you a question?","嗨，能问你个问题吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Iknow iknow but later later ja-ja.","知道知道，不过晚点再说，晚点，哈哈。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Talking about doing things later.","说到晚点再做的事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Unfortunately no but I already have some information where I could look.","很遗憾，还没有，不过已经有些线索，知道能去哪里找。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wow this is to fast but ok i accept it (I would have given it to her for free.","哇，也太快了，不过行，我接受。（其实白送她也愿意。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili why did you say that :s.","莉莉，你干吗那样说:s？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Come on Line, he has it like a stone, don't leave him waiting.","来嘛，莱茵，他都硬得像石头了，别让人等着。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh-ok, you are really exited is kinda... hot.","哦、哦，好吧，你真的很兴奋，有点……性感。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmm... No, because you get excited all the time, but thanks.","嗯……不，你什么时候都兴奋，不过还是谢谢。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Can you take it for me i feel, a little, tired.","你能帮我拿一下吗？我有点，累。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you mister fisherman maybe we can do more things later.","谢谢你，渔夫先生，也许以后还能多玩点花样。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Miss Sieki, what is going on here?","茜姬女士，这是怎么回事？");
 ds_map_add(m,"As she is just starting in all this she will give you a unique experience.","她才刚开始接触这些，会给你独一无二的体验。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh hi theres any problem?","哦，你好，有什么问题吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I lost so much money by becoming a Vip I should ask for a refund.","为了当VIP花了那么多钱，真该要求退款。");
 ds_map_add(m,"But it is true, ask Sieki.","可这是真的，问茜姬去。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you know how much mana it costs me to create stable and secure portals?","知不知道，造出稳定又安全的传送门，要耗我多少魔力？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I do not pay for it, I got it an unofficially way.","我没花钱，是通过非官方渠道弄来的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't waste my time, you don't have enough Arcs.","别浪费我时间，你的阿克币不够。");
 ds_map_add(m,"The prize is that giant gold key must be worth a hundred thousand Arcs.","奖品就是那把巨大的黄金钥匙，肯定值十万阿克币。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This is the place I need to be, I need to go completely feral.","我就该来这儿，彻底放出自己的野性。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Are you coming to confess? My little lost lamb.","来忏悔吗，我迷途的小羊？");
 ds_map_add(m,"It seems that I must teach these bad girls how to behave","看来得教教这些坏女孩，怎样才叫乖。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Where has it been all my life, MAMAAA!","我这辈子怎么现在才发现它，妈妈呀！");
 ds_map_add(m,"With these steps I made my wife fall in love.","我就是靠这几步，让妻子爱上我的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I I think I could be dancing here f-forever.","我、我觉得自己可以在这里跳一、一辈子。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hahaha calm I guess it was for the best <3.","哈哈哈，别激动，我想这样最好<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"OH hehe I can't talk right now I'm busy >3.","哦，嘿嘿，现在没空说话，正忙着呢>3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wow, Line I think the refrigerator is running :V.","哇，莱茵，这冰箱好像在“跑”耶:V。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Of course send me to the patreon page!","当然，带我去Patreon页面！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey if you know someone who came from another dimension and is sick.","喂，如果认识从其他次元过来、又生病的人。");
 ds_map_add(m,"We do free ITS Test if you want.","愿意的话，我们可以免费做性传播感染检测。");
 ds_map_add(m,"finally happy hour is back!","欢乐时光终于回来了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh don't be like that, why don't you come with me ... Line.","哦，别这样，陪我来嘛……莱茵。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Maybe I have seen it but maybe not hee hee.","也许见过，也许没有，嘿嘿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, I will do whatever it takes!","是，我会不惜一切！");
 ds_map_add(m,"...? To be honest, I'm not in the mood for that.","……？说实话，现在没那个心情。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Please Line, just go, do this for me,","求你了，莱茵，走吧，就当是为了我。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Haha it was tough but here is everything.","哈哈，真不容易，不过全都在这里了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am sorry I still do not have them. (Lie)","抱歉，还没凑齐。（撒谎。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"I know I shouldn't rush you or ask but do you have the 3000 Arcs?","知道不该催你，也不该问，不过3000阿克币凑齐了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Red What you've accomplished is incredible.","蕾德，你取得的成就太了不起了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well chara nice to meet you and very charming smile.","那么，查拉，很高兴认识你，你的笑容真迷人。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh you are such a wise little girl *hugs*.","哦，你真是个有智慧的小姑娘。*拥抱*");
 ds_map_add(m,"So why should you be here if you can live relatively well?","既然原本日子过得还不错，为什么要来这里？");
 ds_map_add(m,"You are a very good girl thinking like that.","能这样想，你真是个好姑娘。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh I am new here.","哦，我是新来的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hello I see you don't have the orphanage outfit.","你好，看起来没穿孤儿院的制服。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili in The CumJar <3!","精液罐里的莉莉<3！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Come now Vip Customer.\nFor the best sloppy blojowb in your life!","VIP贵客，现在就来吧。\n享受这辈子最棒、最湿滑的口交！");
