 ds_map_add(m,"I don't recognize you...","我不认识你……");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line, are you okay, did you relax? It's the first time I've seen you like this.","莱茵，你还好吗？放松下来了？第一次看见你这样。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Shit that woman hit me in the balls in the Sabbath.","妈的，那女人在女巫集会里踢了我的蛋。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm half elf so I think it comes from that ahah.","我有一半精灵血统，应该就是因为这个，哈哈。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am waiting, that they attend one of the miners.","我在等他们给一个矿工治疗。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmmm well, if it is something small","嗯，只要是件小事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"If you don't need anything, could you do me a little favor?","没什么需要的话，能帮我个小忙吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh ,well the truth no, but thanks.","哦，其实没什么，不过谢谢。");
 ds_map_add(m,"It can be done without it but it is not recommended.","不做也可以，不过不推荐。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmmm so if someone does it for that place is it necessary what you offer me?","嗯，所以要从那里做，就必须用你这项服务？");
 ds_map_add(m,"You still don't have the money? don't worry, I can wait until you get it.","钱还不够？没关系，我可以等你凑齐。");
 ds_map_add(m,"All right, I'll be waiting here if you change your mind.","好吧，改主意的话，我就在这里等。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes please (pay for the service).","好的，麻烦了。（支付服务费。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you want to pay for anal cleaning services?","是否支付肛门清洁服务费？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Eh.. a-are you ok?(Wow is very pretty)","呃……你、你没事吧？（哇，真漂亮。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"Let's get on with it already then!","那就赶紧开始！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey line, are you really gonna help this brat?","喂，莱茵，你真要帮这个臭丫头？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Alright, get to it then already!","行了，赶快动手！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Are you really going to help a stranger who kicked your ass?","连揍过你的陌生人，也真要帮？");
 ds_map_add(m,"* Faye begins to sob *","*菲开始抽泣*");
 ds_map_add(m,"Are you SURE this isn't the year 3000 AD?","确定这里不是公元3000年？");
 ds_map_add(m,"No, sorry actually it's 201 AO.","不是，抱歉，其实是AO201年。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Dumbass, we've been telling you that from the beginning!","笨蛋，从一开始就在告诉你！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Is she alright? No magicians I've ever known had to chant stuff to cast magic.","她没事吧？我认识的魔法师，没一个需要念叨着施法。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Alright, so let's see some magic!","好，来看看魔法吧！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Faye We have to let ourselves lose!","菲，我们得故意输掉！");
 ds_map_add(m,"It would be a good idea, if we had done some damage!","前提是咱们打得出伤害，那主意才算好！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Very proud of you Line.","很为你骄傲，莱茵。");
 ds_map_add(m,"It sounds like you're leaving.","听起来，你要走了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"We finally had a stroke of luck now it's all over.","终于走运了，这下总算结束。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I was able to create the first primitive, circular body by surface tension.","借助表面张力，我造出了最初的原始圆形身体。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Can I take this criminal with me? It would be a great help.","能把这个罪犯交给我带走吗？能帮上大忙。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey here you don't talk you damn cow!","喂，这儿没你说话的份，臭奶牛！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey! What the fuck are you doing?!","喂！你他妈在干什么？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Go turn on the machine.","去把机器打开。");
 ds_map_add(m,"(Big thing i just won't say anything)","（有什么大不了的，不说话就是。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line, I understand that cows can only say moo.","莱茵，我记得奶牛只能说“哞”。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Uyy look Line is not a cute cow <3?","哎呀，莱茵，这奶牛不可爱吗<3？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sure just give me a second.","好，等我一下。");
 ds_map_add(m,"*whispering * Line turn on the machine and let's get the hell out of here.","*小声说*莱茵，打开机器，我们赶紧离开这鬼地方。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Now you can turn on that machine I have a lot of milk in these udders.","可以打开机器了，我这乳房里全是奶。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I like the place, maybe I killed and drank so much because I was frustrated.","我喜欢这里，也许以前杀那么多人、喝那么多酒，都是因为太压抑。");
 ds_map_add(m,"It seems that we meet again.","看来，又见面了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Tristan is not a puppet!.","特里斯坦才不是傀儡！");
 ds_map_add(m,"And that fairy i guess.","还有那只妖精吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh it's you, you really think i'll stay here forever.","哦，是你，真以为我会永远留在这里？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mm-m moo (what's planned?)","哞、哞哞。（什么计划？）");
 ds_map_add(m,"hey cows just say moo!","喂，奶牛只能说“哞”！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili .. n-do-do not do anything weird please.","莉莉……别、别乱来，求你了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Did you put on your cow clothes?","奶牛装穿好了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"(Wow, just say you want to get milked to the brain)","（哇，想被挤奶挤到脑子都空掉就直说。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey come on, give us a warning, we have done more than any citizen of Elira.","喂，拜托，警告一次就好了吧。我们做的事，比艾莉拉任何市民都多。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wait and how do you know that they made a loan to Line.","等等，你怎么知道她们借钱给莱茵了？");
 ds_map_add(m,"You see that woman with purple hair.","看见那个紫头发女人了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh, I didn't know :c.","哦，我不知道:c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Great let's go right away someone could be in danger.","太好了，马上去，也许有人正遇到危险。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh by the way I think something happened to your friend.","哦，对了，你朋友好像出了点事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey leave her alone!","喂，放开她！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Help the dragon maybe she gives us a reward.","帮帮那个龙女，说不定会给谢礼。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And why don't you help her?!","那你为什么不去帮？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey! what's happening here?","喂！这里怎么回事？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Vasuki The Silver Dragon of Luminous","瓦苏基，卢米纳斯的银龙");
 ds_map_add(m,"We know where it is, we will help you to return home.","我们知道在哪儿，会帮你回家的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili! Excuse her, she was born without touch.","莉莉！抱歉，她天生不懂分寸。");
 ds_map_add(m,"That crystal, why is it so important to you?","那块水晶，为什么对你这么重要？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Relax, it was nothing.","没事，小意思。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wait you forgot to take the crystal.","等等，你忘拿水晶了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey Line I think I have an idea.","喂，莱茵，我有个主意。");
 ds_map_add(m,"get naked, if that doesn't get you noticed, nothing will.","脱光。这样还引不起注意，就没别的办法了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Why did you untie me?!","为什么给我松绑？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh it's out of order, I really want to go to the bathroom :c.","哦，坏了，我真的好想上厕所:c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"No, over my dead body you ruin my whole plan!","不行，想毁掉我的整个计划，除非从我尸体上踩过去！");
 ds_map_add(m,"WHAT? But I'm the one who has to do it.","什么？可这事明明该我做。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't worry SieKi I will run the place even better than you.","别担心，茜姬，我会把这里管得比你还好。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Then she will take your place for a while, Sieki?","茜姬，那就暂时由她代替你？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh I am sorry I am sorry I am running right now.","哦，对不起，对不起，马上就跑。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Of course, there is no problem <3.","当然，没问题<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line, calm down. Ahh, my head, what's happening?","莱茵，冷静。啊，头好痛，怎么回事？");
 ds_map_add(m,"B-ut I am succubus, they should be the ones desiring me more!","可、可我是魅魔，他们不该更想要我吗！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Maybe I better leave.","我还是走吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ugh, what a horrible nightmare has happened?","呃，好可怕的噩梦，发生什么了？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey! What do you think you're doing?","喂！你想干什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hehe I know a way that you can save your little friend.","嘿嘿，我知道一个办法，能救你的小朋友。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I told you that your attempt to catch me was useless.","早告诉你了，想抓我，白费力气。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili! do not be rude.","莉莉！别没礼貌。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ple-please let me go I can not continue like this.","求、求你放我走，不能再这样了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wait please let me talk.","等等，求你，让我说话。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes! I mean no, I dont know D:.","对！我是说，不，不知道D:。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What that hell are you doing?!","你到底在干什么？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh di-did you call me?","哦，你、你叫我？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey you, come here!","喂，你，过来！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili, you are a genius. Are you sure you haven't done this before?","莉莉，你真是天才，确定以前没做过？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ehem, I am going to change my clothes, you-you bring someone.","咳，我去换衣服，你、你把人带来。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't worry, I just said it to make her go away.","别担心，只是想让她走才那么说。");
 ds_map_add(m,"AHh Lili help me!","啊，莉莉，救我！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Shouldn't we take it to the guards?","不该把它交给卫兵吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Look Lili what I found.","看，莉莉，我发现了什么。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Should not we take it to the guards?","不该把它交给卫兵吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey! that ball is not the one I handed it to him, it looks like glass.","喂！这球不是我之前交给他的那个，看起来像玻璃。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm sorry Line I really have to go.","抱歉，莱茵，我真的得走了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"It seems that I must teach these bad girls how to behave.","看来，得教教这些坏女孩，怎样才叫乖。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line these two will not leave the crystal we will have to take it by force.","莱茵，她们两个不肯交水晶，只能硬抢了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Why are your so mean?","为什么这么坏？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I have not rested since I came to this dimension.","来到这个次元以后，我一直没休息。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Now, I just have to ...","现在，只要……");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you very much Line, I can finally return home.","莱茵，太谢谢你了，终于能回家了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"That so terrible she looked such a good woman.","太可怕了，她看着明明是个好女人。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What! we must tell the great captain.","什么！得告诉大队长。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hi Vasuki, what are you doing here?","嗨，瓦苏基，在这里做什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Bell that is beautiful.","贝尔，真美。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, there are a many.","对，有很多。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili don't be mean you can fly, besides I have my tights wet :c","莉莉，别坏心眼，你能飞，可我的连裤袜都湿了:c");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey want to play danglinging-ass-rope? You can play for 50 Arcs.","喂，想玩悬绳荡屁股吗？50阿克币一次。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey to use the onaholes you need a ticket!","喂，使用人形飞机杯需要票！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hi I'm SailorCum just turn around to give you a rimjob.","嗨，我是水手射精娘，转过去，让我给你舔肛。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do not bother them Lili let's keep going.","别打扰她们，莉莉，继续走吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"... Wow, what a dumm ass I will tell her the truth.","……哇，真是个傻子，我去告诉她真相。");
 ds_map_add(m,"... You are lucky to be cute Line.","……莱茵，幸亏你长得可爱。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey wait give me a brake that woman left me a little tired.","喂，等等，让我喘口气，那女人把我弄得有点累。");
 ds_map_add(m,"So you have fun Line? <3","莱茵，玩得开心吗？<3");
 ds_map_add(m,"Attention everyone, the 24 hour marathon begins!","各位注意，24小时马拉松现在开始！");
 ds_map_add(m,"All right girls get into your poses.","好，姑娘们，摆好姿势。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ah yes and that to...","啊，对，还有那个……");
 ds_map_add(m,"UHHH~ I ca not feel my legs.","呜——~腿都没知觉了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am glad that with this I will not disappear from the island he.. hehe.","真高兴，这样就不会从岛上消失了，嘿……嘿嘿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, so what? What will you do?","对，所以呢？你要怎么做？");
 ds_map_add(m,"This will be the deal eat the fura fura fruit and get an assjob from me.","交易是这样：吃下芙拉芙拉果，让我用屁股帮你夹射。");
 ds_map_add(m,"But don't you see that most of the women here are anchored to the walls!","没看见这里大部分女人，都被固定在墙上吗！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lucy, what are you doing here?","露西，你怎么在这儿？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Excellent! Line eats this Fura Fura fruit and Lili let's do our best.","太好了！莱茵，吃下这颗芙拉芙拉果。莉莉，我们全力以赴。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't worry, as long as the line is excited, I can get bigger.","别担心，只要莱茵兴奋，我就能变大。");
 ds_map_add(m,"We will help you with whatever you need.","有什么需要，我们都帮。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you very much <3.","太谢谢了<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I gave him the VIP for God's sake! Pietra stop being so annoying!","我都给他VIP了，天哪！皮埃特拉，别这么烦人！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, what's all the fuss!","喂，吵什么呢！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ohh I am sorry but I do not think I will be able to hold on!","哦，抱歉，我好像坚持不住了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I will eat them now since we ran all the way here and I need to regain energy.","一路跑来，得补充精力，我现在就吃。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ah! ahh, yes, thanks, thank you very much.","啊！啊，对，谢谢，太感谢了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I hope this sticks in your mind the next time you judge someone.","下次评判别人时，希望你还能记得这一刻。");
 ds_map_add(m,"You ask me what I will do, WHAT I WILL DO?!","问我要做什么，我要做什么？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"We'd better leave her alone","还是别打扰她了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wow so she lost everything?","哇，所以她失去了一切？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, but there seems to be something else going on.","对，不过似乎还有别的事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"MMmm she kind of scares me, let's wait for someone else to be brought in.","嗯，她有点吓人，还是等别人被带过来吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"So who goes first?","谁先来？");
 ds_map_add(m,"UY I am sorry I am sorry I did not mean it in a bad way. ;c","哎呀，对不起，对不起，我没有恶意。;c");
 ds_map_add(m,"The VIP ninety-seven, applause for our beautiful Judge!","VIP九十七号，请为我们美丽的裁判鼓掌！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Now it's the fairy Liliana's turn, go to the indicated position.","接下来轮到妖精莉莉安娜，请前往指定位置。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line come on, it's not really that big a deal.","莱茵，别这样，其实真没什么大不了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"The winner of the Competition is Li...Liana!","本场比赛的赢家是，莉……莉安娜！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Until he finally made his decision.","直到他终于下定决心。");
 ds_map_add(m,"... Thank you very much, both of you, for participating.","……非常感谢你们两位参加。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This will be the best, a fairy affected by the energy of a succubus Guau!","这一定最棒，受魅魔精力影响的妖精，哇！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Why are they looking at an empty jar, are they stupid?","她们干吗盯着空罐子看，傻了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Uff very viscous it looks like someone has been to smooshers many times <3.","呼，好黏稠，看来有人没少去揉揉店<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ohhh yes! It was better than running with a branch in my mouth Ruuff!","哦，太棒了！比嘴里叼树枝跑来跑去还爽，汪！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Of course if line <3 and I see that you have improved in combat.","当然，莱茵<3，而且看得出，你战斗也进步了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line! come here is show time.","莱茵！过来，好戏开始。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Shit that's great, how much does it cost?","妈的，太棒了，多少钱？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ahhh! I'm not very good at this but I must keep trying.","啊！我不擅长这个，不过得继续努力。");
 ds_map_add(m,"So please do me a favor and don't tell anyone.","所以拜托，别告诉任何人。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't tell Red how I got it I think she would be sad if she knew.","别告诉蕾德我是怎么弄到的，她知道了一定会难过。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hmm ... okay but don't be as loud as usual, okay Solstice?","嗯……好，不过别像平时那么吵，好吗，索尔斯蒂斯？");
 ds_map_add(m,"What you don't like being with your awesome sister?","怎么，不喜欢和你超棒的姐姐待在一起？");
 ds_map_add(m,"What-what kind of pri-prize.","什、什么样的奖、奖励？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, you the one with blue hair!","喂，蓝头发的那个！");
 ds_map_add(m,"What am I doing, hehe, the club is closed during the day.","我在干什么，嘿嘿？夜店白天不开门。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What? but I just wanted to help. :c","什么？可我只是想帮忙。:c");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sure, all at once, maybe you are an idiot.","对，一股脑全说出来，也许你就是个笨蛋。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I trust that they leave their position again because the house has no value.","那房子没什么价值，我相信他们还会再次擅离职守。");
 ds_map_add(m,"At least it's something.","至少有点收获。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I Hire Alura to help me solve this problem.","我雇了阿露拉，帮我解决这个问题。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Look if you want to help, it's okay, I recognize that you are strong.","想帮忙也行，我承认，你很强。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey there is no need to fight now.","喂，没必要现在就打架。");
 ds_map_add(m,"The two idiots that are guarding the abandoned house invite us.","是看守废弃房屋的那两个白痴叫我们来的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This Slime must be defeated now!","必须立刻打败这只史莱姆！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Is very close to the hospital, where did it come from?","离医院这么近，从哪儿来的？");
 ds_map_add(m,"We must help, hurry Line!","得帮忙，快点，莱茵！");
 ds_map_add(m,"YES YES YES YES OK I WILL DO IT I NEED IT NOW Please let me TOUCH THAT PENIS!","好好好好，我做，我现在就要，求你，让我摸那根鸡巴！");
 ds_map_add(m,"YES PLEASE TAKE MY MONEY!!!","好，求你，拿走我的钱！！！");
 ds_map_add(m,"YES PLEASE TAKE MY MONEY","好，求你，拿走我的钱。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wha-what is so funny?","有、有这么好笑？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh, n-no nothing, I-I have to go now bye.","哦，没、没什么，我、我该走了，再见。");
 ds_map_add(m,"W-whhy? we could have had something beautiful.","为、为什么？明明可以拥有美好的关系。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This smell, UFF, my head is spinning.","这味道，呼，头都晕了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This cock is so steamy.","这鸡巴好热腾腾。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am disgusting.","我真恶心。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I could not tell her the truth.","没法告诉她真相。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh baby you still can't control your impulses but that's okay don't worry.","哦，宝贝，你还是管不住冲动，不过没关系，别担心。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What happened to you and why you smell like that?","出什么事了，身上怎么这味道？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line Finally I find you!","莱茵，终于找到你！");
 ds_map_add(m,"This guy was a danger, a threat.","这家伙很危险，是个威胁。");
 ds_map_add(m,"* sobbing * not until he treats me better and APOLOGIZE!","*抽泣*除非他对我好一点，而且道歉！");
 ds_map_add(m,"* whispering * eh-he Line shut the fuck up, I really feel his killer instinct.","*小声说*呃，莱茵，他妈的快闭嘴，真感觉到他的杀意了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Are you talking to me,crossbreed?!","在跟我说话，杂种？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmm.. huh hi, yo ne-need help?","嗯，呃，你好，需、需要帮忙吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"What's going on, is this really the correct dimension ?!","怎么回事，这真是正确的次元？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"The truth is that it was the slowest option.","其实，那是最慢的办法。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I think ten souls will be enough to load the crystal.","十个灵魂，应该够给水晶充能了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Vital energy is needed to charge the fracture.","给裂隙充能，需要生命能量。");
 ds_map_add(m,"* whispering * ehh Line did you hear where it's going.","*小声说*呃，莱茵，听见这是要拿来做什么了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Vasera the Darkbright","瓦瑟拉，暗中之光");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmm .. I'll get money, I just have to wait.","嗯……会弄到钱的，只需要等。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wa-wait you don't understand.","等、等等，不是你想的那样。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Get ready to kick his ass Line!","莱茵，准备揍烂他的屁股！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh sorry i didn't.","哦，抱歉，我没有。");
 ds_map_add(m,"He-he attacked us.","是、是他攻击我们。");
 ds_map_add(m,"But why we are hiding, is he bad?","可干吗躲起来，他是坏人？");
 ds_map_add(m,"What the hell is going on here?","这里到底怎么回事？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey what are you doing?! you are going to be seeing come here!","喂，干什么，会被看见的，过来！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Take care Naoki my name is Line by the way","保重，直树。对了，我叫莱茵。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh poor thing, do not worry, it happened to everyone.","哦，可怜的，别担心，大家都会这样。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, changing the subject, why did you attack us?!","喂，换个话题，为什么攻击我们？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't really worry I. I even like it.","真不用介意，我、我甚至还挺喜欢。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm really sorry, I don't know wha-what happened.","真的很对不起，不知道发、发生了什么。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line I think I know where the Sabbath is.","莱茵，我想我知道女巫集会在哪里。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sorry dude is in my soul","抱歉，老兄，刻进灵魂了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"*I wish I have bigger tits ;C*","*真希望奶子能再大一点;C*");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmm.. I have never heard that thing on this island.","嗯……没听说岛上有那种东西。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Uff tomorrow when they give us another place let's go back to the Sabbath.","呼，明天换个地方值守，再回女巫集会玩吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh. see Lili? I knew there was something wrong.","哦，看吧，莉莉？就知道有问题。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Why are you apologizing? She attacked us out of nowhere!","道什么歉？她莫名其妙攻击我们！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh, Go-god, are you okay?","哦，天、天哪，没事吧？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili you can stay here I will not force you to follow me.","莉莉，可以留在这里，不会逼你跟来。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I-is our only chance Lili","莉莉，这、这是唯一的机会。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What does our search have to do with this succubus?","我们找人，和这个魅魔有什么关系？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Intertwined forests","交错森林");
 ds_map_add(m,"*DANGER*\nDo not go further into the forest.","*危险*\n切勿继续深入森林。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Too convenient did you really see all that or are you just a pervert?","太巧了吧，真看到了这些，还是单纯是个变态？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hi Line look at me I found a teacher to practice fortune-telling.","嗨，莱茵，看我，找到老师学占卜了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"No you should not do something like that, here. * drools *","不，不该在这里做这种事。*流口水*");
 ds_map_add(m,"What, what's going on?","什么，怎么回事？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I_I have to go now :v","我、我得走了:v");
 ds_map_add(m,"You do not like it? What I did is use your slogan and well re use i-","不喜欢吗？我用了你的口号，然后，重新利——");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line starts to clean the semen puddle as quickly as possible.","莱茵尽可能迅速地清理那摊精液。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, calm down, I won't say a word.","喂，冷静，绝不会说出去。");
 ds_map_add(m,"After a few minutes Alura calms down.","几分钟后，阿露拉冷静下来。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line and Lili hold alura before something bad happens.","莱茵和莉莉抱住阿露拉，免得出事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wof WOOF BArK Bakk GRRrr","汪，汪汪，汪，汪，呜——");
 ds_map_add(m,"* drooling * Im rely ejoyig tis Co-cough!","*流口水*偶真享受这根鸡、咳咳！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Today you will lose your virginity on both sides.","今天，前后两边都要破处。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ehh well yes it i-it's m-my first time (AHhhh I am a horrible hypocrite).","呃，嗯，对，是、是我的第一次。（啊，我真是个可怕的伪君子。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well done Lili. <3","干得好，莉莉。<3");
 ds_map_add(m,"...(fucking fairy)","……（该死的妖精。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"We'll take some time, we'll be doing girl things.","我们要忙一会儿，做点女生之间的事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey hey,I don't want to be part of this conversation anymore.","喂，喂，这话题我不想聊了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Please we need your help? or do you want to see her pee.","拜托，得请你帮忙，还是你想看她尿出来？");
 ds_map_add(m,"*whispering* relax, I'll take care of this.","*小声说*放心，交给我。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, what are you doing here?!","喂，在这里干什么？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"How terrible, then you were right.","太可怕了，原来你是对的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What a disaster.","真是一场灾难。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh ok just try to keep the fire under control.","哦，好，尽量控制住火势。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wait Line didn't do anything I brought her with me it was all my fault.","等等，莱茵什么都没干，是我带来的，全是我的错。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wait I have an idea of how they could get all that money.","等等，我想到他们可能怎么弄到这些钱了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Th-then it was all a misunderstanding.","那、那原来全是误会。");
 ds_map_add(m,"No, thank you very much aunty.","不用了，太谢谢了，阿姨。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What do you think you are doing?!","你以为自己在干什么？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Eh I don't think anyone bakes with a bag full of Arcs next to them.","呃，可没人会一边烤东西，一边在旁边放一包阿克币。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmm it must be nothing I must be a little paranoid.","嗯，应该没什么，是我有点疑神疑鬼。");
 ds_map_add(m,"*coughs* No, it's already kicking in.","*咳嗽*不，已经开始起效了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh god, I can not containt myself, I WANNA DOIT.","天哪，忍不住了，我想做！");
 ds_map_add(m,"*The flower releases a purple smoke*","*花朵释放出紫色烟雾*");
 ds_map_add(m,"The flower took a lot of damage, but I can still save it.","花伤得很重，不过还能救。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh... Oh, god my ass.","哦……天哪，我的屁股。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ya, made me grow a penis... wonder what would happen if a guy ate one?","对，让我长出鸡巴了……不知道男人吃了会怎样？");
 ds_map_add(m,"So? what do we need to grab then?","所以，要拿什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"A potion!? What does it do huh.","药水？！有什么用？");
 ds_map_add(m,"So... um... C-can I ask wh-why your both here? a-and um... how you found me?","所以……呃，能、能问问，你、你们两个怎么来了？还、还有，怎么找到我的？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Naoki uses a chain magic to stop them and administer the pacifying potion.","直树使用锁链魔法制止她们，喂下镇静药水。");
 ds_map_add(m,"The potion is ready.","药水做好了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Uff it is a little hot in here hehe.","呼，这里有点热，嘿嘿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Good show girls and boys it's time to go Line.","演得不错，姑娘小伙们。莱茵，该走了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"You-you are Marael? you do not look like a succubus.","你、你是玛拉艾尔？看着不像魅魔。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, Line then we can continue looking for Marael.","对，莱茵，之后再继续找玛拉艾尔。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do not worry, luckily I fell into this pile of flowers.","别担心，幸好掉进了这堆花里。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Why would someone put this here?","谁会把这个放在这里？");
 ds_map_add(m,"A magic barrier is blocking the way.","一道魔法屏障挡住了去路。");
 ds_map_add(m,"A single chair for a family table.","家庭餐桌旁，只有一把椅子。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Remember the magazines your mother used to have?","还记得妈妈以前藏的那些杂志吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"No, I asked you to help me bring out my succubus side, not to be a criminal!","不，我让你帮我释放魅魔的一面，不是去当罪犯！");
 ds_map_add(m,"yeah, there's something weir here.","对，这里有古怪。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line look at this she has enough food to live here for months!","莱茵，看看，她储备的食物，够在这里住上几个月！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I have a room that I use as a storage room, you can sleep there.","有间当仓库用的房间，可以睡在那里。");
 ds_map_add(m,"But don't worry, the guards should be working to open the exit.","不过别担心，卫兵应该正在想办法打开出口。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mhmm and where is he now?","嗯，他现在在哪儿？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Nice to meet you both and about your friend unfortunately I have not seen her.","很高兴认识你们。至于你们的朋友，很遗憾，没见过。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh... your name was Line right?","哦……叫莱茵，对吧？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you think she is the kidnapper of the forest D:?","她会不会就是森林里的绑匪D:？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Can Ava do that?","艾娃能做到？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili this is what she was hiding she knows Ava!","莉莉，这就是她藏的秘密，她认识艾娃！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wow Lili she just has an apron and she has a big *glup* bum *whispering*.","哇，莉莉，她只穿了条围裙，还有个好大的*咽口水*屁股。*小声说*");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mhmm that's a little strange","嗯，确实有点奇怪。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ah ahmmm wh-what?","啊，嗯，什、什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line! Line! wake up! *whispering*","莱茵！莱茵！醒醒！*小声说*");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ok ok I'll tell Line when she wakes up.","好，好，醒了就告诉莱茵。");
 ds_map_add(m,"It looks like there is a door behind these boxes.","这些箱子后面，好像藏着一扇门。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What-what the fuck are you doing?","什、你他妈在干什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"it is now or never we are going to find out what is behind all this.","就是现在，错过就没机会，去查清这后面的一切。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And what are you going to do with Marael, it's a giant promise you made to her?","那玛拉艾尔怎么办？你可是向她许下了天大的承诺。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you think I could end up like miss marael?","我也可能变得像玛拉艾尔女士那样吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"... I know I am lucky and I will try to make that luck come to you too.","……知道自己很幸运，也会努力把这份幸运带给你。");
 ds_map_add(m,"So true Lili <3 !","说得对，莉莉<3！");
 ds_map_add(m,"That it is good to see new faces for a change.","换换样子，看见新面孔，真好。");
 ds_map_add(m,"She said she had no energy and wanted some time alone.","她说没什么精力，想独自待一阵。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I know that she more than anyone else will want to help these children.","知道她比任何人，都更想帮助这些孩子。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am really sorry.","真的很抱歉。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line please, this is my last chance to be happy in life..","莱茵，求你，这是我这辈子最后一次获得幸福的机会。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't come any closer!","别过来！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line, what are you doing here?!","莱茵，在这里做什么？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"And I am sorry for all that Ava has put you through.","艾娃让你承受了这一切，真的很对不起。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Is ok, everithing will be ok.","没事，一切都会好的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"With the wish I would ask to meet that special someone for me!","有了愿望，我就能找到属于自己的那个人！");
 ds_map_add(m,"This dog seems to be grounded :O.","这狗好像在受禁足:O。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ehh I'm sure Lemmy isn't big enough to cover all the walls.","呃，雷米个头没那么大，不够遮住所有墙吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"God mother fucking, DAMN.","天杀的，操他妈的，靠。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do not worry Lemmy, your mistress will be fine.","别担心，雷米，女主人不会有事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ohh Ok, this is my first time in such a public place.","哦，好，第一次在这么公开的地方做。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Haha Well, I wouldn't mind doing it here, in fact.","哈哈，其实在这里，我也不介意。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wa-wait it is not necessary, Mmm maybe if you reward me with something else.","等、等等，不必这样，嗯，换个奖励也许不错。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What! NO it will be 10,000 Arcs we saw your dirty secret.","什么！不，得10,000阿克币，我们看到了你的龌龊秘密。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Gilfried The Monster Fucker.","吉尔德弗里德，怪物操手");
 ds_map_add(m,"You said that the librarian is always in her own world.","你说过，图书管理员总沉浸在自己的世界里。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Dude she is half succubus.","老兄，她有一半魅魔血统。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ohh it felt so good in my poopa.","哦，小屁屁里好舒服。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Read the back cover.","读封底。");
 ds_map_add(m,"They even stole our sign.","连招牌都偷走了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Is there something wrong Line?","莱茵，有什么不对吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"*Criying* What-are-you-doing? sniff sniff.","*哭泣*你、在、干什么？吸鼻子。");
 ds_map_add(m,"F-Father why did you call me here?","神、神父，为什么叫我来这里？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Eh-eh it's okay * pulls down his pants.","呃，呃，好吧。*拉下裤子。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Stop it Line, stop playing dumb I beg you please don't do it!","住手，莱茵，别再装傻，求你了，别这样！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hehe I guess that is fun <3. take care of yourself.","嘿嘿，应该挺好玩的<3，照顾好自己。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well I guess it is something.","好吧，总算有点用。");
 ds_map_add(m,"So you will not make any money?","所以，就不赚钱了？");
 ds_map_add(m,"What do you mean, relaxed? You should be attentive, you're a guard!","放松？什么意思？你是卫兵，应该留神才对！");
 ds_map_add(m,"That's right, she, our prophet, will die...","没错，她，我们的先知，会死……");
 ds_map_add(m,"Give her the relic, so we can move faster from this hause of stupidity.","把圣物给她，快点离开这座愚蠢之屋。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And how do you know we were coming?","怎么知道我们会来？");
 ds_map_add(m,"At last, you've arrived.","总算来了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am sick and tired of you demigrating me just for being a-","就因为我是个——你们就一直羞辱我，受够了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What are you doing here, you filthy blood?","污秽的血统，来这里做什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I think it's this way.","应该往这边。");
 ds_map_add(m,"That thing, which adults do.","就是大人会做的那件事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What the hell Line, what do you mean?","搞什么，莱茵，说什么呢？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I swear that woman will pay for everything she has done to me.","发誓，那女人一定会为对我做的一切付出代价。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Shut up you racist asshole.","闭嘴，种族歧视的混蛋。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Now I just need to find him","现在只要找到他。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Briefcase Black Mail.","公文包勒索。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Giant Gold Key!.","巨大的黄金钥匙！");
 ds_map_add(m,"False bridge guards switcheroo.","假桥卫兵的掉包计。");
 ds_map_add(m,"(Line opens the briefcase in two and finds hundreds of pictures)","（莱茵把公文包打开，发现里面有几百张照片。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"What must be inside for him to be this desperate?","到底装了什么，能把他急成这样？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Bring the solid gold key to The Bitch","把纯金钥匙交给那个婊子。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, yes, whatever.","好，好，随便。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you very much,but do not say the B word.","太感谢了，不过别说“婊”字。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey isn't that the clothes stolen from smooshers?!","喂，那不是从揉揉店偷来的衣服？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"You can go Line, it can be a lot for you.","莱茵，可以走，这对你来说可能太过了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I hope you enjoyed your time alive.","希望你享受过活着的日子。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Your own minions defying your orders, pathetic.","连自己的手下都不听命令，可悲。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you want me to go back to a pathetic being like you?","想让我变回你这种可悲的存在？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you really want to kill me Line?","莱茵，真想杀我？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I want you to keep it.","我想让你留着。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am stronger than before you need me!","我比以前更强，你需要我！");
 ds_map_add(m,"N-no I am not a coward and I'm a succubus!!! *Eat the fruit*","不、不是胆小鬼，我可是魅魔！！！*吃下水果*");
 ds_map_add(m,"You are pathetic get out of here.","真可悲，滚吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"No-no I cannot do it Big sis.","不、不行，姐姐，我做不到。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Here Line Eat this.","来，莱茵，吃下这个。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thanks Big Sis <3 and good luck in your work. <3","谢谢姐姐<3，祝工作顺利。<3");
 ds_map_add(m,"you can't enter here sorry.","抱歉，不能进去。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, look there is something inside the slime.","对，看，史莱姆里面有东西。");
 ds_map_add(m,"No, I insist I could not leave you alone.","不，我坚持，不能丢下你一个人。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Vasuki you work too much let me help you.","瓦苏基，你太辛苦了，让我帮忙。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, is that slime going to be okay? it's kind of lost its shape.","喂，这史莱姆没事吧，形状好像都散了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"For the future, the children and us I will give my best too!","为了未来、孩子，还有我们，也一定全力以赴！");
 ds_map_add(m,"It was the first thing we did.","这就是我们最先做的事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you think we are idiots?!","以为我们是白痴？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"You are the thieves I've seen them all over the island what is all this?!","你们就是小偷，整个岛上都见过你们，这到底怎么回事？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"The three of us will give you our most precious moment, please help us.","我们三个会献上自己最珍贵的时刻，求你帮帮我们。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I-I I really do not know if I have the ability to get-","我、我真不知道自己能不能筹——");
 ds_map_add(m,"This is a disaster.","真是一场灾难。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Basically, we are still at the same point as before...","基本上，还是回到了原地……");
 ds_map_add(m,"Look, we have a bad reputation and they just don't want to give us work.","我们名声太差了，根本没人肯给工作。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What do you mean it did not work?!","什么叫没用？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, about that it did not work.","对，说到那个，没成功。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I-I really don't know how to thank you for this.","我、我真的不知道怎么感谢。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And who better for a family than Miss Marael! You are a genius!","能给她们一个家的人，谁比玛拉艾尔女士更合适！你是天才！");
 ds_map_add(m,"What, but who Lili?!","什么，可是谁啊，莉莉？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"You know what, I think I know who can help.","我想，知道谁能帮忙了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I will be the best clown on the island! <3.","一定要成为全岛最棒的小丑！<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh you are the best of all heroes!","哦，你是所有英雄里最棒的！");
 ds_map_add(m,"You are the best fri-sisters I could have ever had.","你们是我这辈子最好的朋、姐妹。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Great go to the center of the circle of those people.","很好，到那群人围成的圈中央。");
 ds_map_add(m,"They really mean. * whispers *","真正的意思是。*小声说*");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do not worry, I am a great swimmer and I will win these watersports!","别担心，我游泳可厉害，水上运动一定会赢！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line, what are you doing here? Wait, how did you get in?","莱茵，怎么在这儿？等等，怎么进来的？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Nonsense, I already feel UGH, fine.","胡说，已经感觉，呃，很好。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey I fought for this place and no one will urgh, uagh take it away.","喂，这地方是我争来的，谁也别，呃，啊，想抢走。");
 ds_map_add(m,"*Crowd* Can't you do something else? Yeah, like dancing or something?","*人群*不能干点别的？对，比如跳舞什么的？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wait, her future what?! ugh, URGH.","等等，她以后的什么？！呃，呜。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am-sorry I could not drink it.","对、不起，没喝下去。");
 ds_map_add(m,"No one will take my sweet sunray-colored nectar from me!","谁也别想拿走我甜蜜、阳光色的甘露！");
 ds_map_add(m,"If we put our feet together will you shut up?","我们把脚并在一起，你就闭嘴？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I can not hold on anymore!","再也忍不住了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ahhh how can you make so much trouble.","啊，怎么能惹出这么多麻烦。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you have narcolepsy or what? You always fall asleep or lose consciousness.","有嗜睡症还是怎么，总不是睡着就是昏过去。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well, if we're done here, we'd better get going.","这里忙完，就赶紧走吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"No, I can't draw the sword.","不，拔不出剑。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Our intention was good, it was to help people.","出发点是好的，是想帮别人。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And finish quickly, you do not want your mother to see you <3.","快点弄完，可不想让妈妈看见吧<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Beside I really do not mind at all.","再说，我真的一点都不介意。");
 ds_map_add(m,"OHhhh... Please no.","哦……求你，不要。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I-I am sorry I heard a strange sound I came to see if you were okay.","对、对不起，听见怪声，就来看看你有没有事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"My-my head hurts a little bit.","头、头有点痛。");
 ds_map_add(m,"So I accepted, now Callie is my girlfriend and she looked very happy.","所以我答应了，现在卡莉是我的女朋友，她看着特别开心。");
 ds_map_add(m,"The food was delicious it was a bag of chips for each of us.","饭菜真好吃，每人一袋薯片。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This is what marael said, thinking this way will only destroy my relationships.","这就是玛拉艾尔说的，抱着这种想法，只会毁掉自己的关系。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Clearly she wanted to be with me, but not yet in the way I wanted.","她显然想和我在一起，可还不是我想要的那种方式。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh sure Honey and if we are alone we can take a bath together hehehe.","当然，宝贝，只有我们两个人的话，还能一起洗澡，嘿嘿。");
