 ds_map_add(m,"I know there is something wrong with me.","我知道，自己有问题。");
 ds_map_add(m,"( It cannot be... I-I remember. I am a creep. )","（不可能……我、我想起来了。我是个变态。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"*feels a pressure on her butt* Ah?! What's going on?.","*感觉屁股被顶住*啊？！怎么回事？");
 ds_map_add(m,"AHHh, WAIT ALDO! Oh no... HE-HeheheHE.","啊，等等，阿尔多！哦，不……嘿、嘿嘿嘿嘿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"AHH! I CAN FEEL YOUR THICK AND HOT CUM FILLING ME UP!","啊！能感觉到，你浓热的精液，正在灌满我！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Shit... I'm afraid of what you have to say.","妈的……有点怕听到你接下来要说的话。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Excellent work Line <3.","莱茵，干得太棒了<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh nothing Lili why so serious hehe?","哦，没什么，莉莉，怎么这么严肃，嘿嘿？");
 ds_map_add(m,"... you know very well that this is a lie.","……你明知道，那是谎言。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do I really deserve to be alive?","我真的配活着吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"You are under arrest by the power granted to me by the great captain of Elira!","凭艾莉拉大队长授予的权力，逮捕你！");
 ds_map_add(m,"You are completely crazy if you are not the compatible she will kill you.","彻底疯了，如果不兼容，她会杀了你。");
 ds_map_add(m,"We cannot defeat it","我们打不过。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hours after the mother slime died, all the slimes created by it perished.","史莱姆之母死去几小时后，由它创造的所有史莱姆也一并死亡。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Bu-ut I just wanted to stop this, I-I am a hero I did not want to doom anyone.","可、可只是想阻止这事，我、我是英雄，不想害死任何人。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I-it seems to have worked.","看、看来成功了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I will have to accelerate the investigation for Eleonor's sake and mine.","为了埃莉诺，也为了自己，得加快研究。");
 ds_map_add(m,"It's going to be a long night.","今晚会很漫长。");
 ds_map_add(m,"In the room there is a chair in front of a table, sit there.","房间里有把椅子，就在桌前，坐在那里。");
 ds_map_add(m,"But at night they become very aggressive.","可一到晚上，就会变得非常凶暴。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thi-this place is cursed at night by... people I hold dear to my heart.","夜里，这、这地方被……我心中珍视的人们，诅咒了。");
