 ds_map_add(m,"-_-II that doesn't calm me down.","-_-II这可没让我安心。");
 ds_map_add(m,"So get out of here, you fat, filthy creep!","所以，滚吧，你这个又肥又脏的变态！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well then let's make this a unique occasion, open your eyes now.","那就让这次，成为独一无二的体验。现在，睁开眼。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh-ok I don't mind I would really like to trie new things especially with yo-.","哦、好，我不介意，我真的很想试点新东西，尤其是跟你——");
 ds_map_add(m,"So I have a deal that will benefit both of us.","所以，我有个对我们双方都有好处的交易。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wa-wait! what is happening.","等、等等！怎么回事？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey Line is that you?","嘿，莱茵，是你吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Iughh is drenched in your squirt.","呃，都被你喷出的水浸透了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am going to take it.","我要拿走。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh and she left a letter by your side but your squirt left it on the floor","哦，她还在你旁边留了封信，可被你喷出的水，冲到地上去了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ivy said if she refuses to come with us we can use force.","艾薇说了，她不愿意跟我们走，就可以用强的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes let's go back to mommy hehe.","对，回妈妈那里去，嘿嘿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well done Line, now let's get back to Ivy.","干得好，莱茵，我们回去找艾薇吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Fine, whatever. But if he screws things up worse, I'm blaming you.","行，随便。不过，他要是把事情搞得更糟，我就怪你。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh I-I am sorry, you better find a be-better wizard Line.","哦，对、对不起，莱茵，你还是找个更、更好的法师吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well ... hehehe who knows the truth. but I need your help urgently Naoki.","那个……嘿嘿，谁知道呢。不过，直树，我急需你帮忙。");
