 ds_map_add(m,"Lili !! do not be-believe her, that is false it was not like that.","莉莉！！别、别信她，假的，事情不是那样。");
 ds_map_add(m,"no maldita idiota la informacion sobre tu amiga!","不是，你个该死的蠢货，我说的是你朋友的消息！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey tu la de pelo azul","喂，你，蓝头发的那个。");
 ds_map_add(m,"The three of them start cleaning.","三个人开始打扫。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili you are going to help us <3?!","莉莉，你要帮我们<3？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"No, between the three of us we can really clean it up in minutes.","不，我们三个人一起，几分钟就能打扫干净。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am sorry it was all my fault I will clean all this up.","对不起，都是我的错，我会把这里收拾干净的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"hey don't you owe something to my friend?","喂，你是不是还欠我朋友点什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"*Line uncaps the bottle and Ivy is back to her original height*","*莱茵拔开瓶塞，艾薇恢复了原来的身高。*");
 ds_map_add(m,"I thought you went to the house sorry LilI :c.","我以为你回家了，对不起，莉莉:c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"With this we will enter the sabbath?","这样，我们就能参加魔宴了？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Silently lucy stops telling the story and gets into bed with Line.","露西默默停下讲述，钻进被窝，跟莱茵躺在一起。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hehe you are so excited, I want to know how my adventures inspired you. <3","嘿嘿，你好兴奋。我想知道，你的冒险，给你带来了什么灵感<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"* gasping * so- so what do you think sakura.","*喘气*所、所以，樱，你觉得怎么样？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sakura the succubus Queen of another world","樱：异世界的魅魔女王");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hu-Hu a little pink snack.","呼呼，一个粉红色的小点心。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Dont worry, you'll live as long as you keep satisfying me <3.","别担心，只要继续让我满足，你就能活着<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Great, you are just another pervert.","好极了，你也不过是个变态。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What?! You stared us, while we almost die!","什么？！我们差点死掉，你就一直看着？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wha-what? you saw me do-doing those sthings.","什、什么？你看见我做、做那些事了？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I know, I've been watching all this time.","我知道，我一直都在看。");
 ds_map_add(m,"So you are the adventurer giving false orders to my guards?.","所以，就是你这个冒险者，冒充上级，给我的卫兵乱下命令？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Won't you pray to the goddess of fairies?","你不向妖精女神祈祷吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Damn Line! look at his appearance the guy could not look more dangerous.","妈的，莱茵！看看他的样子，还能更危险一点吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"We got it  lili <3!.","拿到了，莉莉<3！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm sorry but we can't, someone else needs this crystal to return home","对不起，不行。有人还等着这块水晶回家。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you want to sleep and save the game?","要睡觉并存档吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line, I wanted to thank you for helping me catch that criminal.","莱茵，谢谢你帮我抓住那个罪犯。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I could not agree more haha.","完全同意，哈哈。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Dont worry about me Lili, I do not think saying goodbye was necessary <3.","莉莉，别担心我。我觉得，没必要特地道别<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line realizes that she is in her bed and understands that Sam left her there.","莱茵发现自己躺在床上，明白是萨姆把她送回来的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"The fruit made you gro-grow a really big penis.","那颗水果，让你长出了好、好大一根鸡巴。");
 ds_map_add(m,"You-your fruit made me grow this.","你、你的水果，让我长出了这个。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah I think mine is an aphrodisiac, I-I feel kinda hot.","对，我想我这颗有催情作用，我、我感觉好热。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ok i will eat the red one.","好，那我吃红的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wow i've never seen these fruits before.","哇，以前从没见过这些水果。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Also I think there is something more that want me to stay.","而且，我想还有别的东西，想让我留下。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wha-what about-your family?","那、那你的家人呢？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, love was the best, too bad you have to go.","是啊，亲爱的，刚才太棒了，可惜你得走。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Although, it is not that bad.","不过，倒也没那么糟。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ohh finally I will be able to rest a bit","哦，终于能稍微休息一下了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ya ssh sh I need you to put it in, I can't wait!","好了，嘘，嘘，我要你插进来，等不了了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I had not had sex in a while.","我有一阵子没做爱了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I didn't think something like this could happen.","没想到，会发生这种事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"AHHH MY BALLLS!!","啊——我的蛋蛋！！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Good, thanks for asking and what are you doing?.","挺好，谢谢关心，你在做什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"And he said where was he going?","那他说，要去哪里了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hi Equinox, have you seen Naoki?","你好，伊奎诺克斯，见过直树吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Iugg Lili kill me please *covers her face in shame*.","呃，莉莉，杀了我吧。*羞愧地捂住脸*");
 ds_map_add(m,"I recommend less sex if you are not going to take care of your hygiene.","如果不注意个人卫生，我建议，少做点爱。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Perfect, it is only 3000 Arcs","很好，只要3000阿克。");
 ds_map_add(m,"No thanks, right now I need the Arcs.","不用，谢谢，我现在需要这些阿克。");
 ds_map_add(m,"When I clean everything here, you can have another cleaning.","等我把这里清理干净，你就可以再来清洁一次。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh Lily, she looks really disoriented.","哦，莉莉，她看起来很迷茫。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Faye super Soldier of the king","菲伊：国王的超级战士");
 ds_map_add(m,"No, we will have to find one.","没有，我们得找一个。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What are you a hero or something?","你是什么英雄之类的人吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeas yes yes whatever Lili , what do you need beautiful redhead <3?","是是是，随便啦，莉莉。漂亮的红发姑娘，你需要什么<3？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, leave it to me and Lili.","对，交给我和莉莉吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Calm down Lili, she was disoriented from traveling to this dimension.","冷静，莉莉，她刚穿越到这个次元，有点迷糊而已。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Finally, Faye We did it, you see Naoki you had the power to do it.","终于，菲伊，我们成功了！直树，看吧，你有能力做到。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ohh Faye you are a sweetheart <3.","哦，菲伊，你真贴心<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Look like the kettle thing doesn't want you to go to your dimension Faye.","看来，那个水壶一样的东西，不想让你回自己的次元啊，菲伊。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What are you thinking so much?","你在想什么呢，想这么久？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hehe I-I guess <3.","嘿嘿，我、我想是吧<3。");
