 ds_map_add(m,"Here you pay with Arcs, seeing the good side at least now you know.","这里用阿克付钱，往好处想，至少你现在知道了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"No wonder they all came to my hole. :c","难怪他们都来用我的洞:c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"We did it drogitas, we finally have enough gold to buy a boat!","成功了，德罗吉塔斯，我们终于攒够金子，可以买船了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"New offer a20 arcs since she talks a lot!","新报价，20阿克，因为她太吵了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Attention everyone!","大家注意！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah was great thanks Lili! <3","对，太棒了，谢谢莉莉<3！");
 ds_map_add(m,"yeah yeah whatever.","是是是，随便。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you want me to promote the sale of my friends to this band of wankers?","你要我把朋友，推销给这群撸管的家伙？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmm no nothing Lili let's take vasuki to the house.","嗯，没有，没什么，莉莉，我们带瓦苏基回家吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmm yeah... At least she will be happy that all women will get paid.","嗯，是啊……至少，所有女人都能拿到钱，她一定会开心。");
 ds_map_add(m,"It may sound crazy but I think I know where she might be.","听着可能很疯狂，但我好像知道，她可能在哪儿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"We're going to kick your flabby ass that's what we'll do!","我们要踢烂你那松垮垮的屁股，就这么办！");
