 ds_map_add(m,"Are you coming to get new experiences for your next books?","来为下一本书，积累新体验吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ehh what happened? I thought you were going to kick my flabby ass hahahaha.","诶，怎么啦？不是说，要踢烂我那松垮垮的屁股吗，哈哈哈。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Although I don't think it will work Lili is tiny in size no offense.","不过，我觉得不行，莉莉太小了。我说的是体形，别介意。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh Line you are an angel <3.","哦，莱茵，你真是个天使<3。");
