 ds_map_add(m,"But don't they make more money the more sex they have with VIPs?","可她们跟贵宾做得越多，不是赚得越多吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"C'mon, punching me in the face would have hurt less.","拜托，直接往我脸上揍一拳，都没这么伤人。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This guy is everywhere, are there no other people?","这家伙怎么到处都是，没别人了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Whether I was a half elf half succubus... or just an indecent elf","不管我是半精灵半魅魔……还是个不知廉耻的精灵。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line is just a silly competition, i-it's not a big deal.","莱茵，只是场傻乎乎的比赛，没、没什么大不了的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"...Hey ...Line are you okay?","……嘿……莱茵，你没事吧？");
 ds_map_add(m,"You come to congratulate me? you fucking scumbag.","来恭喜我的？你这个混蛋。");
 ds_map_add(m,"( Oh why does she take so long )","（唉，她怎么要那么久。）");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili and Line stare at the fisherman.","莉莉和莱茵，盯着渔夫。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Once you tell me the result you can leave.","告诉我结果，你就可以走了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Estuvo rico uwu.","真舒服uwu。");
 ds_map_add(m,"The two made the VIP ejaculate ninety-seven congratulations.","两人都让九十七号贵宾射了，恭喜。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmmm... if I help you, would you give the jar to my friend?","嗯……我帮你的话，能把罐子给我朋友吗？");
