 ds_map_add(m,"... I will charge more for this.","……这活儿，得加钱。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This must be the last key.","应该是最后一把钥匙了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I BEG YOU I CAN'T TAKE IT ANYMORE","求求你了，我真的受不了了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I don't know, maybe I'm going too far.","不知道，也许我太过分了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm sorry but I don't have the money, it will have to be for later.","对不起，没钱，只能以后了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"*SNIFFING* UOOgh I can feel this smell penetrating my brain!","*使劲嗅闻*呜啊，这股味道，都钻进脑子里了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"* Hyperventilated * Ahh yes I-I think I can smell you from here. * drooling *","*呼吸急促*啊，对，我、我想在这里，都能闻到你。*流口水*");
