 ds_map_add(m,"You did well, I hope the smell of my dick is engraved in your brain for ever.","干得不错，希望我鸡巴的味道，永远刻在你的脑子里。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Uoogg It Stinks.","呜啊，好臭。");
 ds_map_add(m,"She would be so disappointed in me.","她一定会对我，失望透顶。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Rynn fell asleep I guess you were looking for inform-.","琳恩睡着了。我想，你是来打听消——");
 ds_map_add(m,"... I was the one who made him leave, so I guess that makes me a hero.","……是我把他赶走的，所以，我应该也算英雄。");
