 ds_map_add(m,"Lili lo-look at his. his.","莉莉，看、看他的……他的……");
 ds_map_add(m,"No no miss it was my fault I. I cum all over yo your face.","不，不，小姐，是我的错，我、我射了你一、一脸。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Easy we passed as new guards and we will say that these 2 idiots invited us.","简单，冒充新来的卫兵，就说是这两个笨蛋邀请我们的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And yes, it does have giant tits.","对，而且真的有对巨乳。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And how do you know that about Kor?","你怎么知道寇尔这件事？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sabbath what the hell is that?","魔宴？那是什么鬼？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, but it was worth it HAHAHA.","对，可这很值得，哈哈哈。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Man this is the worst.","老兄，糟透了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Good thing I didn't miss anything. * Dam *","幸好，没错过什么。*可恶*");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am so-sorry, I was late?","对、对不起，我来晚了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Bell the florist","花匠贝尔");
 ds_map_add(m,"It's just a flower what do you need us for then?","不就是一朵花，那要我们干什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh no, I am so so-sorry this is all my fault. I should have he-held back.","哦，不，真、真的对不起，全是我的错。我应该忍、忍住的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sorry if I ofend you before.","抱歉，刚才冒犯你了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh, God, are you okay?","哦，天啊，你没事吧？");
 ds_map_add(m,"tsk, you know I'll follow you anyway, don't act like a hero.","啧，反正你去哪儿，我都会跟着，少逞英雄了。");
