 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you very much destiny is very generous it seems.","太感谢了，看来，命运很慷慨。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Is an incense that helps you to have lucid dreams of your memories.","这是一种熏香，能让你在清醒梦中，重温记忆。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh it's because I'm half succubus, it must be my aura that attracts people.","哦，因为我是半魅魔，一定是我的气场，吸引了大家。");
