 ds_map_add(m,"Go to the other room!","去另一个房间！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I have an idea *picks up the gun from the table*","我有个主意。*拿起桌上的枪*");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmm.. must be in the room that the guard is guarding.","嗯……一定在卫兵守着的那个房间。");
 ds_map_add(m,"So far all the rumors have been true.","目前为止，传闻全是真的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"These are... dental records of humans.","这些是……人类的牙科档案。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, the guard will be able to see you if you walk by.","喂，你走过去的话，卫兵会看见。");
 ds_map_add(m,"quick Vasuki use your fire breath.","快，瓦苏基，用火焰吐息。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey what are you doing over there!","喂，你在那边干什么！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lo-look Vasuki, the table is full of Arcs.","看、看啊，瓦苏基，桌子上全是阿克。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh Line you are such a good person I guess that's why I like you hehe.","莱茵，你真是个好人，所以，我才喜欢你吧，嘿嘿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Is part of the onahole contract is their dental insurance and records.","这是肉便器合同的一部分，包括牙科保险和档案。");
 ds_map_add(m,"But you're crazy! at least you have proof of it?!","你疯了吧！至少，得有证据啊？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"What the hell are you talking about?","你到底在说什么鬼话？");
 ds_map_add(m,"What any person would do, justice!","任何正常人都会做的事，伸张正义！");
 ds_map_add(m,"looks like someone is baking something.","好像有人，在烤东西。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes... but these are strange, I've never seen them moving like this.","是啊……可这些很奇怪，从没见过它们这样动。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wh-what is wrong?","怎、怎么了？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Bell is that the flower you are looking for?","贝尔，那就是你要找的花吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Take *coughs* the flower Line quickly please.","莱茵，快，拿走*咳嗽*那朵花，求你了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am... more than perfect. *gasping*","我……好得不能再好了。*喘气*");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm sorry Line the flowers made me more aggressive, are you okay?","对不起，莱茵，那些花，让我变得更暴躁了，你没事吧？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Didn't you eat those fruits with Vasuki?","你不是跟瓦苏基，一起吃过那些水果吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well? Do you need any help? With the potion perhaps?","怎么样，需要帮忙吗？比如，那个药水？");
