 ds_map_add(m,"Ehh, forget what I said, it's really n-nothing!~~","呃，忘了我刚才说的吧，真、真的没什么！~~");
 ds_map_add(m,"F-f-fine!~ I-i was going to use it to... p-pacify a w-werewolf...","好、好、好吧！~我、我本来想用它……安、安抚一只狼、狼人……");
