 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, be careful not to stumble.","嗯，小心，别绊倒。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line gets out of there, you will fall down!","莱茵，离开那里，会掉下去的！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line for God's sake, are you okay?!","莱茵，老天，你没事吧？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wait a little while I'll help you stand up.","等等，我扶你起来。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line please dont die!","莱茵，求你别死！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Are you ok darling?","亲爱的，你没事吧？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Uhmm.. it looks like there is a cave behind the barrier.","嗯……屏障后面，好像有个洞穴。");
 ds_map_add(m,"She doesn't even have a chair for her husband.","她连给丈夫坐的椅子，都没有。");
 ds_map_add(m,"hehe how can I forget that","嘿嘿，我怎么会忘呢。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Cookbooks, how to raise a child and romance novels.","菜谱、育儿书，还有爱情小说。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili, you are a very bad influence, you know that?","莉莉，你知道吗，你真把人带坏了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wow here ... she keeps her erotic books.","哇，这里……放着她的色情书。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Until next time, your favorite succubus -Willow Adams.","下次再见，你最喜欢的魅魔——薇洛·亚当斯。");
 ds_map_add(m,"If you need me, I'll be in the kitchen.","需要的话，我就在厨房。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you very much Miss Marael for everything. <3","玛拉艾尔女士，真的谢谢你为我们做的一切<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ohh I guess there's nothing left to do but wait. :c","哦，看来，除了等待，也没别的办法了:c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Let's search the house she must have another way out of this place.","搜搜这栋房子，她一定还有别的路，能离开这里。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Was the only thing in that cave, maybe she uses that hole to trap people.","洞穴里只有那个，也许，她就用那个洞，困住别人。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, I noticed that too.","对，我也注意到了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you think she heard us?","你觉得，她听见我们了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"LINEE! I have something for you come to the kitchen.","莱茵——！有东西给你，来厨房。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Not that I know, besides, why is this succubus hiding?","据我所知，没有。再说，这只魅魔，为什么要躲起来？");
 ds_map_add(m,"But what is this about an angel granting wishes?","可天使实现愿望，到底又是怎么回事？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't worry it was my fault and always will be.","别担心，这是我的错，永远都是。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh dont worry would you like some 'PIE', Darling....?","哦，别担心，想尝点“馅饼”吗，亲爱的……？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Excited is not enough to describe what I'm feeling right now, momy.","妈妈，“兴奋”，根本不足以形容我现在的感觉。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Are you excited about the gift I'm going to give you darling?","亲爱的，想到我要给你的礼物，兴奋吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes yes I am sorry :c","嗯，嗯，对不起:c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Uhh no way, I'm exhausted, let's do it better tomorrow.","呃，不行，累坏了，还是明天再做吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Marael went to sleep and told us not to go out until the morning.","玛拉艾尔睡了，叮嘱我们，早上之前，别出门。");
 ds_map_add(m,"It is important so I will repeat it, do not leave this room until morning.","很重要，所以再说一遍，天亮之前，不许离开这个房间。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Good night darling.","晚安，亲爱的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"let's wait for Marael to go to sleep to investigate further.","等玛拉艾尔睡着，我们再继续调查。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I cannot leave yet without knowing something about Ava.","没问出艾娃的消息，我还不能走。");
 ds_map_add(m,"These pies helped us to find marael.","这些馅饼，帮我们找到了玛拉艾尔。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili Marael is not in her room sleeping.","莉莉，玛拉艾尔没在自己房间里睡觉。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This will increase your damage but reduce the amount of life you recover.","这会提高你的伤害，但减少生命恢复量。");
 ds_map_add(m,"... I will not promise but if I can do something I will let you know.","……我不能保证，不过，能做点什么的话，会告诉你的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Aghh I feel strange, a little more awake and very hungry.","啊，感觉很奇怪，清醒了点，还特别饿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I told Ms. Marael everything.","我把一切，都告诉了玛拉艾尔女士。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't d-do this to me, I-I beg you.","别、别这样对我，我、我求你了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Miss Marael-that's one of the stolen relics!","玛拉艾尔女士，那是被盗的圣遗物之一！");
 ds_map_add(m,"When Marael stopped crying she fell asleep.","玛拉艾尔哭完后，睡着了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm really sorry I'm sorry I just wanted to be happy!","真的对不起，对不起，我只是想幸福！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I-I'm really sorry, but-but what choice did I have?","真、真的对不起，可、可我还能怎么办？");
 ds_map_add(m,"No darling, you are wrong, I have nothing to lose, because I have nothing.","不，亲爱的，你错了。我没什么可失去，因为，我一无所有。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah, BAD, BAD DOGGY!","对，坏狗，坏狗狗！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm sorry, Miss, but the library is closed..","抱歉，小姐，图书馆关门了……");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh thanks I guess, bye Lemmy.","哦，算是谢谢吧，再见，雷米。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Where did so many tentacles come from, was it you lemmy?","哪儿来的这么多触手，雷米，是你弄的？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Just a little bit more!!!","再来一点！！！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ah, ah ah here it is.","啊，啊啊，在这里。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Shit Line pulls out the key!","妈的，莱茵，把钥匙拔出来！");
 ds_map_add(m,"*Line and Lili enter the carriage*","*莱茵和莉莉走进马车。*");
 ds_map_add(m,"He wants us to get into the carriage.","他想让我们上马车。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lemmy we brought the key to your mistress.","雷米，我们给你女主人，把钥匙带来了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"But what about the librarian?","可图书管理员呢？");
 ds_map_add(m,"... I don't know why I ask, go on.","……真不知道，我为什么要问，继续吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wait Line, you really don't want the 1000 Arcs?","等等，莱茵，你真不要那1000阿克？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, packed full of pictures of you fucking monster girls!","对，里面全是，你跟魔物娘做爱的照片！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh you saved my life take 1000 Arcs for your trouble.","你救了我的命，这1000阿克，作为辛苦费吧。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah Oohw, I swear it's the first time it's happened.","对，呜，我发誓，第一次这样。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wha what happend?","怎、怎么了？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah that was better than I imagine you are not a just a regular elf.","对，比想象中还棒，你可不是普通精灵。");
 ds_map_add(m,"*snif snif* Ok :c.","*吸吸鼻子*好吧:c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh I am sorry I am sorry I am sorry :c.","哦，对不起，对不起，对不起:c。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili the author lives on the island!","莉莉，作者就住在岛上！");
 ds_map_add(m,"But it's okay, I'll get over it.","不过没关系，我会走出来的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Shit, you're so annoying are you part of this yes or no?!","妈的，你真烦，到底还参不参与？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I know you are angry, but don't screw with the father.","我知道你很生气，可别拿神父出气。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What, what's wrong, it wasn't daytime, why, it's nighttime?","什么，怎么回事，刚才不是白天吗，怎么，天黑了？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Haha Hi Line, look where I got a job.","哈哈，莱茵，你好，看看，我在哪里找到工作了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, yes, yes I have one eye open relax.","好，好，好，我会留个心眼，放心。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Save her, for yourself, for all of us, for the world. *Starts praying.*","救她，为了你自己，为了我们所有人，为了世界。*开始祈祷。*");
 ds_map_add(m,"B-b-but if she can't get out-","可、可、可她要是出不来——");
 ds_map_add(m,"The day all the relics were stolen, she was behind this door.","所有圣遗物被盗的那天，她就在这扇门后面。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh, wh-what's happening?","哦，发、发生什么了？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Our goddess has spoken to us through the light of a thousand colors.","我们的女神，透过千色之光，向我们传达了旨意。");
 ds_map_add(m,"*slaps her face* shut up you slut and get out of here.","*扇了她一巴掌*闭嘴，婊子，滚出去。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What-what are you doing? You can't do that here, it's a sin!","你、你在干什么？这里不能做这种事，这是罪！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ay Line speaks clearly, you're an adult for fuck's sake.","哎，莱茵，说清楚点，你他妈已经是成年人了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"It's, that smell you know, when you do that thing.","就是，那股味道，你知道，做那种事的时候。");
 ds_map_add(m,"*hug* all right, let's get out of here.","*拥抱*好吧，我们走。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line are you ok?","莱茵，你没事吧？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Then she ended up in the street because of his parents' abandonment.","然后，她因为父母的遗弃，流落街头。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I will do it for you father, but not for this creature from hell.","神父，我是为了您，才这么做，可不是为了这个地狱来的怪物。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line, let's get us out of here, remember that Ava needs you.","莱茵，走吧，记住，艾娃还需要你。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I ended up selling the key to the secret fight club hidden in the forest.","最后，我把钥匙，卖给了藏在森林里的秘密搏击俱乐部。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, he looked very desperate.","对，他看起来，绝望极了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"* Line receives the key * ... thanks.","*莱茵接过钥匙*……谢谢。");
 ds_map_add(m,"On behalf of the secret fight club, I declare the title of.","我代表秘密搏击俱乐部，授予你称号：");
 ds_map_add(m,"She just hiss at me?","她刚才，是在冲我嘶嘶叫？");
 ds_map_add(m,"No! we must help him.","不！我们得帮他。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I can feel it, it's here.","感觉得到，就在这里。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Come on Line it's time to finish this.","来吧，莱茵，该结束这一切了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm going to wipe you completely off the face of existence.","我要把你，从存在本身，彻底抹除。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Please, Mr. Vasera, let me help you.","瓦瑟拉先生，求你让我帮忙。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I thought it was your favorite of the clones, you kept sucking like crazy.","我以为，那是你最喜欢的分身呢，你一直吸得像疯了一样。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh thank you but why give me this, I thought I was just a simple subditee?","哦，谢谢。不过，为什么送我这个？我以为，自己只是个小跟班？");
 ds_map_add(m,"I don't need something as pathetic as you.","我不需要，像你这么可悲的东西。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Please don't kill me.","求你别杀我。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What?! I am no-not going to do it here, a-are you crazy?","什么？！我才不、不会在这里做，你、你疯了吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"To be the one who wants his desire fulfilled and who wants it now.","当那个想满足欲望，而且，现在就要的人。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I just want you to be more active not everyone likes a scared or shy girl.","我只想让你更主动些，不是每个人，都喜欢畏畏缩缩、害羞的姑娘。");
 ds_map_add(m,"He tipped you 50 Arcs!","他给了你50阿克小费！");
 ds_map_add(m,"You are a natural Smoosher Line!","莱茵，你简直是天生的斯慕舍服务员！");
 ds_map_add(m,"At least he tipped you 10 Arcs.","至少，他还给了10阿克小费。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Watch out Vasuki!","瓦苏基，小心！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Vasuki What are you doing here?!","瓦苏基，你怎么在这里？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Regardless of where she got it from, we have to go to the next location!","不管她从哪儿弄来的，我们得去下一个地点！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hahaha Line you were awesome. <3","哈哈哈，莱茵，你太棒了<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"There is nothing to stop us!","没什么能挡住我们！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, don't WOOORRRRYYY.","对，别——担——心——。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Y-yes, here we will know more information about Ava.","对、对，我们会在这里，知道更多艾娃的消息。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you really want to enter?","真想进去？");
 ds_map_add(m,"This is the place, I think.","应该，就是这里。");
 ds_map_add(m,"If so, I will give my all and find a job!","如果是这样，我会全力以赴，找份工作！");
 ds_map_add(m,"But they said that since we are children of sin we deserved our destiny.","可他们说，我们是罪恶生下的孩子，活该受这样的命运。");
 ds_map_add(m,"... Hey I-I will not turn you over but you all will have to stop stealing.","……听着，我、我不会告发你们，可你们得停止偷窃。");
 ds_map_add(m,"We are 3.000 Arcs under budget that would give us a little time but not much.","还差3000阿克，补上后，能撑一阵子，可也不会太久。");
 ds_map_add(m,"We also do not want to work in the VIP area and continue with the cycle.","我们也不想去贵宾区工作，把这种循环，继续下去。");
 ds_map_add(m,"... Well it doesn't matter it's all over now.","……算了，无所谓了，一切都结束了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"And you are the hero, who screwed up all our plans.","你就是，毁掉我们全部计划的那个英雄。");
 ds_map_add(m,"We were not able to steal any crystal.","我们没能偷到，任何一块水晶。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What are we going to do now?","现在，该怎么办？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Stop it, I will give you the same, please help us.","别说了，我也会给你一样的，求你帮帮我们。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Come on Line just look at this place it's a mess-","来嘛，莱茵，看看这里，都乱成什么样了——");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey Line, you really didn't think-","嘿，莱茵，你不会真以为——");
 ds_map_add(m,"I only ask to go somewhere else where no one can see us.","我只要求，换个没人能看见我们的地方。");
 ds_map_add(m,"See what you have done here. You are the hero you always wanted to be.","看看，你在这里做成了什么。你已经是，自己一直想当的那个英雄。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Will you do it or not!","到底做不做！");
 ds_map_add(m,"*Face Palm* Line are not that kind of watersport just look out over there.","*捂脸*莱茵，不是那种“水上运动”，看那边。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What about me, can I help?","我呢，能帮忙吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Would not it be better to have a swimming pool?","有个游泳池，不是更好吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ahh, I told you that you needed to take a few days.","啊，我早说了，你得休息几天。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I swear I will try again if you give me the opportunity.","我发誓，再给一次机会，一定会努力。");
 ds_map_add(m,"URGH, Gulp, BLEEEh.","呃，咕噜，呕——");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't take my place urhhhhhggg BLEEh!","别抢我的位置，呃——呕！");
 ds_map_add(m,"S-she will be okay?","她、她会没事吗？");
 ds_map_add(m,"It is sad but true.","很难过，可这就是事实。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ahh ya buckle down and pee like a doggie.","啊，好了，蹲下，像小狗一样尿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Uff tell me about it.","呼，可不是嘛。");
 ds_map_add(m,"AY don not bother me, I drank too much","哎，别烦我，喝太多了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"*Throws his clothes* MY GREAT INGENUITY!","*扔下衣服*我伟大的聪明才智！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well now that we are here what do we do now?","好，既然到了，现在干什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Finally we arrive on the island Eleonor and I will start the work of our lives!","终于抵达岛上了，我和埃莉诺，将开始一生最重要的工作！");
 ds_map_add(m,"It is okay aldo you do not have to be embarrassed.","没事，阿尔多，不必害羞。");
 ds_map_add(m,"What-what's up Line?","什、什么事，莱茵？");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ahh! - I-I do not feel well.","啊！我、我不舒服。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I hope to do my best, maybe this is my place.","希望我能尽力，也许，这里就是我的归宿。");
 ds_map_add(m,"She angrily took my hand and with anger she told me.","她愤怒地抓住我的手，怒气冲冲地对我说：");
 ds_map_add(m,"*blush* oh sure I would really love that... honey <3.","*脸红*哦，当然，真的很愿意……亲爱的<3。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I-I want to do this, I need it so bad I love you-I love you mommy!","我、我想这么做，真的太需要了。我爱你，我爱你，妈妈！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line is this is the best, better than masturbating. * penetrates harder *","莱茵，太棒了，比自慰舒服多了。*插得更用力*");
 ds_map_add(m,"More, hit me harder!","再来，打得更用力！");
 ds_map_add(m,"OH, oh, oh, Yessssss, I needed this!!!!!","哦，哦，哦，对——，我太需要这个了！！！！！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, Aldo please, listen to me.","喂，阿尔多，求你听我说。");
 ds_map_add(m,"( I have to stop this! )","（必须停下来！）");
 ds_map_add(m,"Of course that happe-","那当然发——");
 ds_map_add(m,"But-but, you did, it was when you came into my room when I was masturbating.","可、可是，你做过。就是我自慰时，你进我房间的那次。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Y-you told me to come here.","是、是你叫我过来的。");
 ds_map_add(m,"This was a dream, was it not? no-no! it was a nightmare-this never happened.","这是梦，对吧？不、不！是噩梦，这从没发生过。");
 ds_map_add(m,"AH, AH-AH, AHHHH, HAVING SEX WITH MY STEPSON IS THE BEST!!!","啊，啊、啊，啊——，跟继子做爱，最棒了！！！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Look, Aldo, the truth is that...","听着，阿尔多，其实……");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah, hey we need to talk, it is very serious.","嗯，喂，我们得谈谈，很严重的事。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey... what were you doing?","嘿……刚才在做什么？");
 ds_map_add(m,"But I assure you we did our best!","不过，我保证，我们已经尽力了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, i-it's not your fault, I-I am trying to be something of a hero too.","嘿，不、不是你的错，我、我也想努力，成为英雄。");
 ds_map_add(m,"There is no reason to believe you.","没有任何理由，相信你。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Enough! You psycho, it ends here!","够了，疯子，到此为止！");
 ds_map_add(m,"I think I am going to throw up.","我快吐了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"this lunatic has been abducting women and turning them into slime.","这个疯子，一直绑架女人，把她们变成史莱姆。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Consume, this means... this blood?!","吞噬，这意思是……这些血？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Eleonor my love Consume them, please, one more time.","埃莉诺，我的爱人，吞噬她们，求你了，再来一次。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Raise your hands where I can see them and come with me!","举起手，让我看见，跟我走！");
 ds_map_add(m,"CONSUME THEM ELEONOR!","吞噬她们，埃莉诺！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't you dare talk to my wife like that!","不许这么跟我妻子说话！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Vasuki, if I don't do it we will die anyway.","瓦苏基，我不这么做，我们照样会死。");
 ds_map_add(m,"I have no other options.","别无选择了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"Dr. Isic Arumov did not face justice due to his mental state.","伊西克·阿鲁莫夫博士，因精神状况，未能接受审判。");
 ds_map_add(m,"You selfish fool, you condemned all the women who became Slime!","自私的蠢货，你让所有变成史莱姆的女人，都没救了！");
 ds_map_add(m,"They murdered all the women in Big Dream.","大梦酒吧里的女人，全被他们杀了。");
 ds_map_add(m,"T-Then what do we do?!","那、那我们怎么办？！");
 ds_map_add(m,"Let's go Line I feel that there is something very wrong here!","走吧，莱茵，感觉这里，有什么很不对劲！");
